    "summary": "Your Shooting Phase. Pick a NECRONS unit of yours that has yet to be picked to shoot. Through this phase, its models can reroll Hit rolls of 1 when their target is within half the firing weapon’s range. If a NECRONS CHARACTER leads the unit, its models can reroll any Hit roll against targets in that same range instead.",
